  "body": "For every user in the room we currently have a dedicated state event for them.  For large rooms with many 1000s or more members this becomes less than ideal  due to the overhead for both clients and servers.\n\nThe protocol itself only requires knowledge of which servers are in the room.\n\n(Imported from https://matrix.org/jira/browse/SPEC-36)\n\n(Reported by @erikjohnston)\n",
